  The pedestal-free estimator subtracts a low frame-quantile, which on a
  WIDE true response removes genuine off-peak signal. Its recovery ratio
  is therefore <= 1 by construction and it is CONSERVATIVE against the
  deconvolution proposal. The raw estimator is generous. Truth is between.

